(text "Frames" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 24.13 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "677e5ea7-20bf-5c06-bc66-d55ea59410a0"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: shield-can frames on the back (PCB-T-06, PCB-EMC-03), one per frame of\n   shields.toml: SoC and LPDDR4X; Radio module.\n2. Absent state: dnp in both variants: fitted only if EMC or audio measurements require\n   (BOM v1 line 90); the lands and keep-outs stay on the board either way.\n3. Two-piece, etched to the board's outline (amended T1-038): frame soldered, lid clipped.\n   Height with lid 1.5 mm (PCB-Z-01, the back pocket); lid 0.1 mm and 0.1 mm clearance leave\n   1.3 mm for the parts inside. None on the front (PCB-Z-03).\n4. Geometry: hardware/t1-main-board/shields.toml: land 0.4 mm, keep-out 0.5 mm outside\n   (PCB-T-06) and 0.3 mm inside; lid, clearance, land and the inner keep-out UNVERIFIED\n   until the maker's drawing." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 134.62 0) (size 129.54 26.67) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2a9fc14e-913d-55fb-bbc3-6971d5f7c19d"))
